                <pb facs="0064" n="56" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg56"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/2591: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Braden</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-02-19T20:00:00-05:00">February 19, 1941—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>48. Your despatch no. 1335, February 3, 1941. Please indicate to the Department
                    in as much detail as is readily available what types of public works projects
                    the Colombian Government may wish to carry out with Export-Import Bank
                    assistance within the next 2 or 3 years.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
